# PR #1188 runs this gate in lane 2 of the parallel `lint` matrix. It pays for
# the first `cargo test --test unit` build, about eight minutes with its run,
# so it runs beside the other lanes instead of before them.
# One CI gate, one file. The deletability half of plan 02 L18 -- the fragment
# bootstrap is a runtime seed, so the suite must stay green when the seed is
# moved aside, and a forgotten fragment must rediscover to the same content id.
# `rust-script scripts/run-ci-gates.rs --stage rust` runs them.
ci_gate check-bootstrap-deletability
  stage rust
  lane 2
  description "The fragment bootstrap is deletable: an absent seed yields an empty, logged catalog and a forgotten fragment rediscovers to the same content id, all offline."
  run "cargo test --manifest-path rust/Cargo.toml --test unit coding_discovery::fragment_catalog -- --nocapture"
  justification "Without this gate a stale seed lets the fragment bootstrap produce an empty catalog with no log line, hiding the regression until an end-to-end test fails; introduced in #1138 (commit bcf1e8edb)."
